description	"Keldor Warrior

^2Weaponry:
- Vibro-ax
-- ^6Purple ^7Style Only
- Dual DL-44's (3)

^8Attributes:
- Heal (1)

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]

Kel Dors were noted for their simple approach to justice, and they typically saw moral issues in black and white. On one hand, the Kel Dor were noted for their hospitality; they would never turn away a stranger in need. Yet, Kel Dors were not averse to taking the law into their own hands, and had no compunctions about putting to death a thief who was merely stealing to feed himself."